# Code owners
#
# Every path needs an owner so review requests route automatically instead of
# being asked for in chat. Later rules win, so the specific entries at the bottom
# override the broad ones above.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
